  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Civil Society in Myanmar &#x2013; Paung Ku</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Myanmar, civic space has considerably shrunk since the military coup. In the absence of a legitimate government, networks of independent civil society organisations (CSOs) are essential actors for basic service provision and promotion of democratic values and human rights. Showing commitment to localisation, Switzerland will enable local CSOs to further support vulnerable communities and to protect the foundations of a pluralistic and inclusive society.</narrative>
  </description>
